# ԿՆԻՔ — all optional. With none of these set the invitation runs
# exactly as it does in the demo: the RSVP form works, records nothing, and
# SAYS SO rather than pretending the message was sent.

# The public origin. Until this is an https URL, OG tags stay relative and
# nothing emits a localhost address into a production build.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# --- RSVP delivery: pick ONE ------------------------------------------------

# (a) Email via Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=
RSVP_TO=
RSVP_FROM=invitation@resend.dev

# (b) or POST the answer anywhere — a Google Apps Script bound to a Sheet is
#     the usual choice for a wedding, since the couple wants a guest list they
#     can sort, not an inbox.
RSVP_WEBHOOK=

# --- The couple's dashboard ---------------------------------------------------
# /guests shows every answer with totals and a CSV export Excel opens cleanly
# (Armenian intact — the file carries a UTF-8 BOM). Off until this is set;
# then the couple opens /guests?key=<value>. 8+ characters.
RSVP_ADMIN_KEY=

# --- DURABLE STORAGE — required to SELL this on Vercel ------------------------
#
# Without these, records go to data/*.jsonl. That is durable on a VPS or any
# host with a disk, and it is LOST on Vercel, whose filesystem is per-instance
# and read-only: a minted short link cannot be found by the next request, an
# RSVP is written into a void, and an uploaded photo dies on redeploy.
#
# Set both and the guest book, the order book and the short links move to
# Upstash Redis over REST — no npm dependency, no connection pool, and a link
# becomes a key lookup instead of a scan through every link ever minted.
#
# Where to get them: create a free Upstash Redis database (upstash.com), or add
# Vercel KV to the project, which is Upstash underneath. Either naming works —
# Vercel KV injects the KV_* pair automatically:
#   KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN          (Vercel KV)
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL / UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN  (Upstash direct)
#
# Unset means OFF, and off means the files — so dev and a VPS are unchanged.
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
